      "challengedBy": [],
      "claim": "In `GoogleCalendarService.refreshAccessToken`, the code assigns `const key = parseRefreshTokenResponse(googleCredentials, googleCredentialSchema);` and then stores `key` into `prisma.credential.update({ data: { key } })`. Because the helper now returns the Zod result wrapper instead of the credential payload, the persisted credential key no longer matches the shape `googleCredentialSchema.parse(credential.key)` expects on the next load.",
